{"time": 1755440714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193001756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056340271", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“在回去的路上再买点零食，可以吗姐姐大人？”"}
